# Secrets only. Copy to `agent/.env` (git-ignored) and fill in what you need.
#
# Provider, model, timeouts and loop caps are NOT set here — they live in
# `config.toml` at the repo root, which is the file you edit to switch models.
# Anything set here still overrides config.toml, which is useful for a one-off
# but is a trap if you forget it, so keep this file to credentials.
#
# Check what is actually in effect:
#     cd agent && uv run python -m agent_app.cli --show-config

# Local Ollama needs no credentials at all — leave this file empty for it.

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# AWS Bedrock. The region also lives in config.toml under
# [llm.presets.bedrock]; set it here only to override that.
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
# AWS_SESSION_TOKEN=...
# AWS_REGION_NAME=us-east-1
